# Testid renames to {area}-{entity}-{action}, applied by rename-testids.ts (its header has the syntax
# and the rebase recipe). Testids that already follow the convention keep their names.
# The first matching line wins.

# A Modal's or Popover's trigger is `<its testid>-trigger`. This line has to come before the
# lines that would match a trigger too (`any-record-of-filter-modal-<id>` matches
# `any-record-of-filter-modal-1-btn`), and after the testids that end in `-btn` but aren't a
# trigger although their stem is a testid.
add-filter-btn -> genomic-filter-add
<id>-btn -> <id>-trigger

